DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These functions return the cosine of _x, where _x is given in radians.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       On success, these functions return the cosine of _x.

       If _x is a NaN, a NaN is returned.

       If  _x is positive infinity or negative infinity, a domain error occurs,
       and a NaN is returned.

