       has occurred when calling these functions.

       The following errors can occur:

       Domain error: _x is an infinity
              _e_r_r_n_o  is set to EEDDOOMM (but see BUGS).  An invalid floating‐point
              exception (FFEE__IINNVVAALLIIDD) is raised.

